{"id":"b1c18a144a85b6d5","group":"57","path":"57/57-thm-lindstrom.md","title":"Lindström Theorem","display":"thm-lindstrom — Lindström Theorem","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Mathematical Logic","book_abbrev":"57","label":"57-thm-lindstrom","aliases":["57-thm-lindstrom"],"display":"thm-lindstrom — Lindström Theorem","depends_on":["[[57-df-abstract-logic]]","[[57-df-compactness-property]]","[[57-df-downward-LS-property]]","[[57-df-sentence]]","[[57-df-satisfaction]]","[[57-df-reduct]]","[[57-df-substructure]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Mathematical Logic"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"57"},{"key":"label","html":"57-thm-lindstrom"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>57-thm-lindstrom</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-lindstrom — Lindström Theorem"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"337462c47a6e0696\" href=\"?note=337462c47a6e0696\" title=\"57-df-abstract-logic\">57-df-abstract-logic</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"348361ab4be85a8d\" href=\"?note=348361ab4be85a8d\" title=\"57-df-compactness-property\">57-df-compactness-property</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"0d3445b68d4cfbdb\" href=\"?note=0d3445b68d4cfbdb\" title=\"57-df-downward-LS-property\">57-df-downward-LS-property</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"38cb16fd577caf7b\" href=\"?note=38cb16fd577caf7b\" title=\"57-df-sentence\">57-df-sentence</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"03dc48eb29950767\" href=\"?note=03dc48eb29950767\" title=\"57-df-satisfaction\">57-df-satisfaction</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"6a64ba5f871237a2\" href=\"?note=6a64ba5f871237a2\" title=\"57-df-reduct\">57-df-reduct</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"90dc104b21b5c21e\" href=\"?note=90dc104b21b5c21e\" title=\"57-df-substructure\">57-df-substructure</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L\">\\(\\mathcal L\\)</span> 采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"348361ab4be85a8d\" href=\"?note=348361ab4be85a8d\" title=\"57-df-compactness-property\">57-df-compactness-property</a> 的语义表示；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal V\">\\(\\mathcal V\\)</span> 包含全部所需一阶字母表，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{DLS},\\mathrm{DownLS}\">\\(\\mathrm{DLS},\\mathrm{DownLS}\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"0d3445b68d4cfbdb\" href=\"?note=0d3445b68d4cfbdb\" title=\"57-df-downward-LS-property\">57-df-downward-LS-property</a>。假定以下条件作为本定理的前提：</p>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sen}_{\\mathrm{FO}}(S)=\\mathrm{Sent}_S\">\\(\\operatorname{Sen}_{\\mathrm{FO}}(S)=\\mathrm{Sent}_S\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\models_{\\mathrm{FO}}\">\\(\\models_{\\mathrm{FO}}\\)</span> 是本册一阶语义；对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span> 有 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j_S:\\mathrm{Sent}_S\\to\\mathcal L(S)\">\\(j_S:\\mathrm{Sent}_S\\to\\mathcal L(S)\\)</span>，满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\forall\\mathfrak A,\\sigma\\;(\\mathfrak A\\models\\sigma\\leftrightarrow\\mathfrak A\\models_{\\mathcal L}j_S(\\sigma))\">\\(\\forall\\mathfrak A,\\sigma\\;(\\mathfrak A\\models\\sigma\\leftrightarrow\\mathfrak A\\models_{\\mathcal L}j_S(\\sigma))\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span> 及 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma,\\tau\\in\\mathcal L(S)\">\\(\\sigma,\\tau\\in\\mathcal L(S)\\)</span>，存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\neg_{\\mathcal L}\\sigma,\\sigma\\wedge_{\\mathcal L}\\tau\\in\\mathcal L(S)\">\\(\\neg_{\\mathcal L}\\sigma,\\sigma\\wedge_{\\mathcal L}\\tau\\in\\mathcal L(S)\\)</span>，在全部 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span>-结构上分别满足经典否定、合取的真值等式。</p>\n<p>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\\subseteq S&#39;\">\\(S\\subseteq S&#39;\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L(S)\\subseteq\\mathcal L(S&#39;)\">\\(\\mathcal L(S)\\subseteq\\mathcal L(S&#39;)\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak A\\models_{\\mathcal L}\\sigma\\leftrightarrow\\mathfrak A\\upharpoonright S\\models_{\\mathcal L}\\sigma\">\\(\\mathfrak A\\models_{\\mathcal L}\\sigma\\leftrightarrow\\mathfrak A\\upharpoonright S\\models_{\\mathcal L}\\sigma\\)</span>。每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma\\in\\mathcal L(S)\">\\(\\sigma\\in\\mathcal L(S)\\)</span> 属于某个非逻辑符号有限的子字母表 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S_0\">\\(S_0\\)</span> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L(S_0)\">\\(\\mathcal L(S_0)\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>对每个保持符号种类及元数的单射重命名 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\rho:S\\to S&#39;\">\\(\\rho:S\\to S&#39;\\)</span>，存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\rho_*:\\mathcal L(S)\\to\\mathcal L(S&#39;)\">\\(\\rho_*:\\mathcal L(S)\\to\\mathcal L(S&#39;)\\)</span>，满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak A\\models_{\\mathcal L}\\rho_*(\\sigma)\\leftrightarrow\\rho^*(\\mathfrak A)\\models_{\\mathcal L}\\sigma\">\\(\\mathfrak A\\models_{\\mathcal L}\\rho_*(\\sigma)\\leftrightarrow\\rho^*(\\mathfrak A)\\models_{\\mathcal L}\\sigma\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\rho^*(\\langle A,I\\rangle)=\\langle A,I\\circ(\\rho\\upharpoonright(S\\setminus(\\mathrm{Var}\\cup\\mathrm{LogSym})))\\rangle\">\\(\\rho^*(\\langle A,I\\rangle)=\\langle A,I\\circ(\\rho\\upharpoonright(S\\setminus(\\mathrm{Var}\\cup\\mathrm{LogSym})))\\rangle\\)</span>（逻辑字母和变量固定）。</p>\n<p>对每个非逻辑符号有限的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S_0\\in\\mathcal V\">\\(S_0\\in\\mathcal V\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma\\in\\mathcal L(S_0)\">\\(\\sigma\\in\\mathcal L(S_0)\\)</span> 及新一元关系符号 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P\">\\(P\\)</span>，存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma^P\\in\\mathcal L(S_0\\cup\\{P\\})\">\\(\\sigma^P\\in\\mathcal L(S_0\\cup\\{P\\})\\)</span>。对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S_0\\cup\\{P\\}\">\\(S_0\\cup\\{P\\}\\)</span>-结构 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak A\">\\(\\mathfrak A\\)</span>，令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D=P^{\\mathfrak A}\">\\(D=P^{\\mathfrak A}\\)</span>；要求 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak A\\models_{\\mathcal L}\\sigma^P\">\\(\\mathfrak A\\models_{\\mathcal L}\\sigma^P\\)</span> 当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D\\ne\\varnothing\">\\(D\\ne\\varnothing\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D\">\\(D\\)</span> 包含每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S_0\">\\(S_0\\)</span>-常量的解释且对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S_0\">\\(S_0\\)</span>-函数的解释封闭，并且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"((\\mathfrak A\\upharpoonright S_0)|_D)\\models_{\\mathcal L}\\sigma\">\\(((\\mathfrak A\\upharpoonright S_0)|_D)\\models_{\\mathcal L}\\sigma\\)</span>。限制结构的关系解释为原关系与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D^n\">\\(D^n\\)</span> 的交，函数为限制映射。若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D\">\\(D\\)</span> 为空或不封闭，右侧按假值定义，不计算无定义的限制结构。相对化仅作用于已给定的有限支持语言，不要求单句同时断言任意无限语言中全部函数的封闭性。各条真值等式均对相应类型的全部结构、句子量化。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L_1\\le\\mathcal L_2\\leftrightarrow\\forall S\\in\\mathcal V\\;\\forall\\sigma\\in\\mathcal L_1(S)\\;\\exists\\tau\\in\\mathcal L_2(S)\\;\\forall\\mathfrak A\\in\\mathrm{Struct}_S\\;(\\mathfrak A\\models_{\\mathcal L_1}\\sigma\\leftrightarrow\\mathfrak A\\models_{\\mathcal L_2}\\tau).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal L_1\\le\\mathcal L_2\\leftrightarrow\\forall S\\in\\mathcal V\\;\\forall\\sigma\\in\\mathcal L_1(S)\\;\\exists\\tau\\in\\mathcal L_2(S)\\;\\forall\\mathfrak A\\in\\mathrm{Struct}_S\\;(\\mathfrak A\\models_{\\mathcal L_1}\\sigma\\leftrightarrow\\mathfrak A\\models_{\\mathcal L_2}\\tau).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L\\ge\\mathrm{FO}\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{FO}\\le\\mathcal L,\\qquad\\mathcal L\\equiv\\mathrm{FO}\\leftrightarrow(\\mathcal L\\le\\mathrm{FO}\\land\\mathrm{FO}\\le\\mathcal L).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal L\\ge\\mathrm{FO}\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{FO}\\le\\mathcal L,\\qquad\\mathcal L\\equiv\\mathrm{FO}\\leftrightarrow(\\mathcal L\\le\\mathrm{FO}\\land\\mathrm{FO}\\le\\mathcal L).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Compact}(\\mathcal L)\\land\\mathrm{DownLS}(\\mathcal L)\\to\\mathcal L\\equiv\\mathrm{FO}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{Compact}(\\mathcal L)\\land\\mathrm{DownLS}(\\mathcal L)\\to\\mathcal L\\equiv\\mathrm{FO}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>仅有一个 AAL 演绎闭包不满足 Lindström 定理的语义框架。这里明示 FO 扩张、布尔运算、重命名、相对化、约化与有限出现条件；不改 AAL 的定义。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"57-df-abstract-logic","status":"resolved","id":"337462c47a6e0696","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-abstract-logic]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-compactness-property","status":"resolved","id":"348361ab4be85a8d","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-compactness-property]]","embed":false},{"target":"